# OpenOCD connect: select SWD, read DPIDR, clear errors, power up the
# debug port (CTRL/STAT acknowledges), then the user's CTRL/STAT read
# and the switch back to JTAG at shutdown
LINE_RESET
JTAG_TO_SWD
LINE_RESET
DP R 0x0 OK 0BC11477
DP W 0x0 OK 0000001E
DP W 0x8 OK 00000000
DP W 0x4 OK 50000020
DP R 0x4 OK F0000020
DP W 0x4 OK 50000000
DP R 0x4 OK F0000000
DP R 0x4 OK F0000000
DP R 0x4 OK F0000000
DP W 0x4 OK 50000001
DP R 0x4 OK F0000001
DP R 0x4 OK F0000001
LINE_RESET
SWD_TO_JTAG
